# Git authorship

- All commits and PRs must be attributed only to the repo owner (Nishanth K R / Nishanth1409).
- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: cursoragent`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any Cursor attribution trailer to commit messages or PR bodies.
- Do not pass `--trailer` with Cursor attribution when committing.
- If a commit message somehow includes Cursor attribution, remove it before pushing.
